    "sauce_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "building-the-sauce",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-sheet {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    max-width: 22ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    max-width: 68ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col h3 {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__foot {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-sheet {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-sheet__cols {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  .sea-sheet__fig {\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__fig img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__figcap {\n    margin: 10px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sea-sheet\">\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__eyebrow\">How the sauce actually gets built</p>\n  <h2 class=\"sea-sheet__heading\">The sauce is blended, not reduced &mdash; and the spices are bloomed apart from it.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__lede\">\n    Butter chicken gets its body from long simmering. This gets it from roasted squash put through a\n    blender, which is why it takes fifty minutes instead of two hours. That means three separate\n    moves, and doing them in the wrong order is the only way to get a flat, raw-tasting sauce.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-sheet__cols\">\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col sea-sheet__col--pick\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">1</span>\n      <h3>Roast the pumpkin, don't boil it</h3>\n      <p>425&deg;F until the edges caramelise. That browning is where the sweetness comes from, and\n      you cannot get it back later &mdash; simmered squash makes a sauce that tastes thin and\n      vegetal no matter what you add to it.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">2</span>\n      <h3>Vent the blender lid</h3>\n      <p>Let the pumpkin cool a few minutes, then blend with the coconut milk on low before you go\n      up. Hot liquid turns to steam in a sealed jug and pushes the lid off &mdash; keep it vented and\n      hold a towel over the top.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">3</span>\n      <h3>Bloom the spices separately</h3>\n      <p>Garam masala, crushed cardamom, garlic and ginger in butter for about 45 seconds, until they\n      smell fragrant rather than dusty. Fat carries those flavours in a way liquid does not. Then\n      pour the sauce in.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"sea-sheet__fig\">\n    <img\n      src=\"{{ '20260825-Stetten-Wilson-82.jpg' | file_url }}&amp;width=760\"\n      alt=\"Blended pumpkin and coconut sauce being poured into a pot of bloomed spices\"\n      width=\"1200\"\n      height=\"1600\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      decoding=\"async\">\n    <figcaption class=\"sea-sheet__figcap\">\n      The two halves meet here &mdash; blended sauce into bloomed spice, not the other way round.\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 24,
